// The voxel grains, in metres, shared by every export recipe that voxelizes. `vehicle` is for vehicles, furniture and
// parts made to attach to them and matches deadvox's vehicle voxels; `gun` is for firearms and their magazines, whose
// sights and small controls are finer detail than `item` holds; `item` is for every other item or component.
{
  vehicle: 0.03125,
  gun: 0.004,
  item: 0.01,
}
